OL,3,GNEWSAVisitors disturb bird site and
OL,4,Apose for nest cam
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitors to a nature reserve are
OL,7,Fdisturbing wildlife and putting the
OL,8,Flandscape at risk, according to the
OL,9,Fcharity that manages the site.
OL,11,FThe RSPB says it has seen an increase
OL,12,Fin antisocial behaviour at Arne nature
OL,13,Freserve, near Wareham, Dorset, and
OL,14,Fpeople have been dropping cigarette
OL,15,Fbutts and ignoring signs aimed at
OL,16,Fprotecting birds.
OL,18,FIt cited one incident in July when a
OL,19,Ffamily disregarded "no landing" signs
OL,20,Fnear breeding oystercatchers and were
OL,21,Feven captured pulling faces into a nest
OL,22,Fcamera.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
